00:09:16,363 --> 00:09:22,363
Spies in Disguise is a animation, action, adventure film directed by Nick Bruno.

3
00:13:54,545 --> 00:14:00,545
Super spy Lance Sterling and scientist Walter
Beckett are almost exact opposites.

4
00:18:32,727 --> 00:18:38,727
Lance is smooth, suave and debonair.

5
00:23:10,909 --> 00:23:16,909
Walter is… not.

6
00:27:49,090 --> 00:27:55,090
But what Walter lacks in social skills he makes up for in smarts and invention,
creating the awesome gadgets Lance uses on his epic missions.

7
00:32:27,272 --> 00:32:33,272
But when events take an unexpected turn, Walter and Lance
suddenly have to rely on each other in a whole new way.

8
