14
01:04:54,545 --> 01:05:00,545
Spies in Disguise is a 2019 American animated spy comedy film starring Will
Smith and Tom Holland, and produced by Blue Sky Studios.

15
01:09:32,727 --> 01:09:38,727
Directed by Troy Quane and Nick Bruno and written by Brad Copeland and Lloyd
Taylor, the film also stars Rashida Jones, Karen Gillan and DJ Khaled.

16
01:14:10,909 --> 01:14:16,909
The plot involves a secret agent who is transformed into a pigeon by an intelligent young scientist; the two must then
work together to stop a revenge-seeking cybernetic terrorist, and return the agent to his human form.

17
01:18:49,090 --> 01:18:55,090
The film premiered at the El Capitan Theatre on December 4, 2019, and was
theatrically released in the United States on December 25 by 20th Century Fox.

18
01:23:27,272 --> 01:23:33,272
The film received generally positive reviews from critics, and
grossed $172 million against a $100M budget.

19
01:28:05,454 --> 01:28:11,454
It was the final feature film to be produced by Blue
Sky Studios, which closed in 2021.

20
01:32:43,636 --> 01:32:49,636
The film explores themes of inventor, spy, villain, pigeon, aftercreditsstinger.

21
01:37:21,818 --> 01:37:27,818
The tone is lighthearted.
